1.25
 71
1
  3
NOTES\P1. The 3D model pet_case.step (source pet_case.step.py) is\Pthe master; undimensioned features per model.\P2. FDM, PETG, 0.4 nozzle, 0.12-0.16 layers, 3-4 walls, 30\P% infill.\P3. Angles are CCW from +X, seen from the front (display\Pside).\P4
  3
. Display clamp legs 4x %%c2.4 at 40/140/205/335 deg, 1.5\Pshort of the display PCB (tape).\P5. The lug plate sets the orientation (no key tabs). Hook\Pnotches: 4 on the rim at 20/160/230/310 deg, 2 on the lug\Psides.\P6. XIAO pin rails x = +-6.75..+
  3
-9.3, 2 x 7 holes %%c1.2 at\Px = +-7.62, pitch 2.54: the header pins press in and carry\Pthe USB-C force (tune PIN_HOLE_D). Tape pad 8 x 8 for 0.5\Pmm tape; stop rib 12 wide at the antenna end.\P7. Battery side ribs 0.8 thick x 2 high. Battery switch
  1
\PEG1390 between two 0.8 end stops beside the XIAO, actuator\Pthrough the 1.4 x 3.4 slot.\P8. Reset hole %%c2 (pin, cover off). Print plate down, no\Psupports.
  7
