1
  3
NOTES\P1. The 3D model pet_case.step (source pet_case.step.py) is the\Pmaster; undimensioned features per model.\P2. FDM, PETG, 0.4 nozzle, 0.12-0.16 layers, 3-4 walls, 30 %\Pinfill.\P3. Angles are CCW from +X, seen from the front (display side).\P4.
  3
 Snap hooks 6x 5 wide: 4 on the rim at 20/160/230/310 deg, 2\Pon the lug edges at y = 34.1; profile per detail E.\P5. Retention ramp 45 deg: the cover is removable (pry at the\Phousing notch, 230 deg). The housing groove edge sits 0.08 into\Pthe ramp
  1
, so the hooks pull the cover in.\P6. Battery switch slot 1.4 x 3.4 thru (tape over it).\P7. Print plate down, hooks up, no supports.
  7
